00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:03.600
- This song is called
"Hey There, Delilah."

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.840
Everyone always asks me if
there's really a Delilah

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:08.760
and if that's really her name.

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:11.130
And yes, there is a real Delilah,

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:14.013
and her name actually is
Delilah, believe it or not.

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:18.810
But the story behind the
song, we never dated.

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:20.340
It was just a girl that I met

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:23.610 position:58%
that went to school in New York City,

00:00:23.610 --> 00:00:25.260
and

00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:27.630
I just thought she was very pretty,

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:29.850 position:61%
and she inspired me to write this song.

00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:32.067
So this is "Hey There, Delilah."

